#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The AUC measures how well a model ranks good above bad credits, independent of a decision threshold, which makes it the most informative metric on this imbalanced dataset (70% good credits). In Kipu Quantum's benchmarks, the quantum-transformed features on their own reached an AUC similar to the classical baseline, and the hybrid model, which combines both, reached the highest AUC and F1 score. The quantum-transformed features therefore add information that the classical features do not provide on their own.\n"
msgstr "Sinusukat ng AUC kung gaano kahusay ranggo ng isang model ang good sa ibabaw ng bad na kredito, na hindi nakadepende sa decision threshold, kaya ito ang pinakamakabuluhang metric sa imbalanced na dataset na ito (70% good na kredito). Sa mga benchmark ng Kipu Quantum, ang mga quantum-transformed na feature nang mag-isa ay umabot sa AUC na kahawig ng classical baseline, at ang hybrid model, na pinagsasama ang dalawa, ang umabot sa pinakamataas na AUC at F1 score. Kaya nagdaragdag ang mga quantum-transformed na feature ng impormasyong hindi naibibigay ng mga classical na feature nang mag-isa.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clean up (optional) {#clean-up-optional}"
msgstr "Maglinis (opsyonal) {#clean-up-optional}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A fitted mapping stays available until you delete it. If you do not want to map further data with it, delete it. A deletion does no quantum work, uses no QPU time, and cannot be undone.\n"
msgstr "Mananatiling available ang isang na-fit na mapping hanggang burahin mo ito. Kung ayaw mo nang magmapa ng iba pang data gamit nito, burahin ito. Walang quantum work ang pagbura, hindi ito gumagamit ng QPU time, at hindi na ito mababawi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Conclusion {#conclusion}"
msgstr "Konklusyon {#conclusion}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "What you accomplished {#what-you-accomplished}"
msgstr "Ano ang natapos mo {#what-you-accomplished}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this tutorial, you accomplished the following:\n"
msgstr "Sa tutorial na ito, natapos mo ang mga sumusunod:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepared a real-world credit risk dataset with categorical and numerical attributes for quantum feature extraction.\n"
msgstr "Naghanda ng real-world na credit risk dataset na may categorical at numerical na attribute para sa quantum feature extraction.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Established a classical random forest baseline.\n"
msgstr "Gumawa ng classical random forest baseline.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Used Rimay to fit a quantum feature mapping on quantum hardware and map the training and test sets in one run.\n"
msgstr "Ginamit ang Rimay para mag-fit ng quantum feature mapping sa quantum hardware at imapa ang training at test set sa isang run.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Trained the same model on quantum-transformed and on combined features, and compared them with the baseline.\n"
msgstr "Na-train ang parehong model sa mga quantum-transformed na feature at sa pinagsamang mga feature, at inihambing ang mga ito sa baseline.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Key takeaways {#key-takeaways}"
msgstr "Mga pangunahing aral {#key-takeaways}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Rimay fits into an existing machine learning pipeline as one additional preprocessing step. You keep your data preparation and your classical model.\n"
msgstr "Bumabagay ang Rimay sa umiiral na machine learning pipeline bilang isang karagdagang preprocessing step. Nananatili ang data preparation at ang classical model mo.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The number of qubits bounds the number of input features, and the number of rows times `shots` bounds the size of a single job.\n"
msgstr "Ang bilang ng qubit ang naglilimita sa bilang ng input feature, at ang bilang ng row na i-multiply sa `shots` ang naglilimita sa laki ng isang job.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the quantum-transformed features combined with the original features as a default, because the model can use both.\n"
msgstr "Gamitin bilang default ang mga quantum-transformed na feature na isinama sa orihinal na mga feature, dahil magagamit ng model ang pareho.\n"

